  "identifier": "mixvlmc",
  "description": "Estimates Variable Length Markov Chains (VLMC) and VLMC with covariates from discrete sequences. Supports model selection via information criteria, likelihood computation, prediction and simulation of new sequences from an estimated model. See Bühlmann, P. and Wyner, A. J. (1999) <doi:10.1214/aos/1018031204> for VLMC and Zanin Zambom, A., Kim, S. and Lopes Garcia, N. (2022) <doi:10.1111/jtsa.12615> for VLMC with covariates.",
  "name": "mixvlmc: Variable Length Markov Chains with Covariates",
